hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16001","Abu Ahmad al-Zubayri narrated to us, Abu al-Nu'man Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Nu'man al-Ansari narrated to us, from his father, from his grandfather, and he had met the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said, the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Apply kohl with perfumed ithmid, for it clears the eyesight and grows the hair."
"16169","Ali ibn Thabit narrated to us, he said: Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Numan ibn Mabad ibn Hawdhah al-Ansari narrated to me, from his father, from his grandfather, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) commanded with scented ithmid at sleep."
